  "_comment": "Generated from decompiled Ball X Pit enums, cross-checked against https://ballxpit.wiki.gg/wiki/Buildings and per-level wiki pages. 'id' values are a frozen ID registry shared by the ballxpit apworld's item_name_to_id/location_name_to_id (same numeric id used for both the item and location of a given entry - safe since AP keeps those in separate namespaces), computed as 900100 + the entry's ordinal position in the real BuildingType enum - so a later-added entry's id is fixed by its enum position, not by append order. Buildings not confirmed against the wiki (likely unused/cut BuildingType enum values - granting them does nothing visible in-game, confirmed live) were dropped rather than guessed at. The 8 kXIdol entries (display name '... Trophy') are the per-level first-completion reward buildings - confirmed real and live (granted automatically on first level completion) but initially missed because they aren't on the general Buildings wiki page, only inferable from the per-Level pages; added after being reported as still-vanilla behavior post-launch. Do not renumber surviving entries if this file is regenerated again - only append or drop.",
